             model-names.json lookup, the page B model key rule.
  ADV-6 FIX  `aaIndex` indexes every direct model key first, then every
             alias, so a direct key wins over an alias whatever the file
             order.
  ADV-7 FIX  `netScoreOf` reads `byEffort` by `Object.hasOwn` only, so a
             variant named `__proto__` or `constructor` finds no entry and the
             primary row applies.

